note right of "ores::synthetic::feed::fx_spot_feed"
Implements ores.marketdata's IFeed. start() runs the tick loop on the calling
thread, so the caller owns a dedicated std::thread. Each tick steps the
stochastic process, builds one fx_spot_tick, and publishes it to the NATS
subject. The feed writes no market data: ores.marketdata.service's ingest loop
subscribes and persists. qualifier() is derived from ore_key at construction,
so a key that does not parse yields an empty qualifier.
end note

