    +role() : const string&
    +conflict_key() : string
}
note right of "ores::synthetic::feed::ir_curve_feed"
Implements IFeed. One short-rate step fans out to N tenor ticks: every
resolved entry's rate comes from the same state's discount_factor() through
price_ir_curve_entry(), so the batch is by construction a slice of one
internally consistent curve. It publishes N individual messages that share one
datetime, not one aggregate payload. conflict_key() combines qualifier and
role, so a discount curve and a projection curve for the same
currency/index/tenor run side by side.
end note

