unified subject synthetic.v1.tick.<kind>.<source>. A sandboxed binding instead
publishes under synthetic.v1.sandbox.tick.<source>, which the ingest loop's
bound-feed subscription never matches, so a sandboxed feed is structurally
unreachable from the bound-feed resolution path.
