note top of "ores::synthetic::feed::make_fx_spot_feed"
Free function. It builds an fx_spot_feed from a persisted config and its
gmm_component rows, ready to start() on its own thread. A config with
price_source "vintage" resolves its initial price from a real
market_observation instead of the stored gmm_initial_price; "fixed" uses the
