note top of "ores::synthetic::feed::make_ir_curve_feed"
Free function. Shared by auto-start and the on-demand start path, so the two
cannot drift. It resolves the template through resolve(), materialises the
process through map_parameters_to_yield_curve_process(), and looks the initial
rate up through auth_nats delegated with the caller's bearer token, so the
lookup runs in the caller's own tenant and party context (market_observation
is tenant-scoped under RLS). An empty token falls back to the service
account's own identity, as auto-start requires.
end note

