note right of "ores::eventing::domain::entity_event_traits"
Template specialisations in ores.synthetic's eventing headers, one per event
struct. The automated pass skips template declarations, so none of the nine
appears. Each states its subject_prefix and converts a generic
entity_event_notification into the entity's own event: the notification
carries the key as raw JSON, and only the entity knows which columns its key
record holds. Each entity's changes are announced on three subjects, one per
action, so the traits state the prefix and the action completes it. The event
structs themselves are declared in the messaging headers.
end note

